#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:5
#: f0746df42390432488b472b2879a6fc6
msgid "Arming and Disarming"
msgstr "解锁与加锁"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:7
#: 38d9c2826ac24d43916722b81ac3c964
msgid ""
"This page explains how MAVLink can be used by a ground station or companion "
"computer to arm or disarm a vehicle.  The user wiki page for :ref:`arming "
"and disarming is here <copter:arming_the_motors>`."
msgstr "本页介绍地面站或伴飞计算机如何通过 MAVLink 对飞行器进行解锁或加锁。用户 wiki 中关于解锁与加锁的页面请参阅相关链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:10
#: 2020e82bd20d4a3aacdb294e1f1a39d7
msgid "MAV_CMD_COMPONENT_ARM_DISARM within COMMAND_LONG"
msgstr "COMMAND_LONG 中的 MAV_CMD_COMPONENT_ARM_DISARM"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:12
#: 0d7a8ad632fa4bcfaa0f17407f952dcc
msgid ""
"Attempt to arm or disarm the vehicle by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with the "
"command, param1 and param2 fields set as specified for the "
"`MAV_CMD_COMPONENT_ARM_DISARM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_COMPONENT_ARM_DISARM>`__"
" command."
msgstr ""
"通过发送 COMMAND_LONG 消息来尝试解锁或加锁飞行器，其中 command、param1 和 param2 字段按照 "
"MAV_CMD_COMPONENT_ARM_DISARM 命令的规定进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:81
#: ea904ec6a51743a49451945cd9e78f0e
msgid "**Example**"
msgstr "**示例**"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:83
#: dd947f07879e44de93c17036644dddfb
msgid ""
"The example commands below can be copy-pasted into MAVProxy (aka SITL) to "
"test this command.  Before running these commands enter, \"module load "
"message\""
msgstr ""
"以下示例命令可复制粘贴到 MAVProxy（即 SITL 软件在环仿真）中进行测试。运行这些命令前，请先输入「module load message」。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:86
#: 4bc011dcc051414e8822a384f0377f23
msgid "Example MAVProxy/SITL Command"
msgstr "MAVProxy/SITL (软件在环仿真) 示例命令"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:86
#: 881ac323574c450c86569c11e5bfdea2
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:88
#: 8825cdb42c4b4e46813926570a7a6b9c
msgid "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 400 0 1 0 0 0 0 0 0``"
msgstr "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 400 0 1 0 0 0 0 0 0``"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:88
#: c465183a3c634c278fd4ad2df11f2020
msgid "arm the vehicle (may fail because of arming checks)"
msgstr "解锁飞行器（可能因解锁检查失败而无法解锁）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:90
#: 256f289378ac49079c436deae6ef8e40
msgid "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 400 0 1 21196 0 0 0 0 0``"
msgstr "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 400 0 1 21196 0 0 0 0 0``"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:90
#: 53b2e41a228d44acbb33148bc68a116c
msgid "force arm the vehicle (try to bypass arming checks)"
msgstr "强制解锁飞行器（尝试绕过解锁检查）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:92
#: ca57f0495a6845039d81aa4525ade187
msgid "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 400 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0``"
msgstr "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 400 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0``"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:92
#: c5a26418165f4e59860a427ef9c6cb31
msgid "disarm the vehicle (may fail if not landed)"
msgstr "加锁飞行器（若未着陆可能失败）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:94
#: 9917b8ab51384c43bebae2cb8b8a8837
msgid "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 400 0 0 21196 0 0 0 0 0``"
msgstr "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 400 0 0 21196 0 0 0 0 0``"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-arming-and-disarming.rst:94
#: 92ca95274a8048cd99d9adaa8f6a62ca
msgid "force disarm the vehicle even if flying"
msgstr "即使正在飞行也强制加锁飞行器"
